  "One-minute unlock": "一分钟解锁",
  "*Circle to Search*, *Frame gen*, *Gestures* and *Routines* need one permission that Android only gives through its own settings. Three short steps, about a minute, and you never do it again.": "*即圈即搜*、*插帧*、*手势*和*自动化场景*需要一项权限，而 Android 只在系统设置里提供。三个小步骤，大约一分钟，以后不用再做。",
  "Is this safe?": "这安全吗？",
  "Let's go  →": "开始  →",
  "Show hidden settings": "显示隐藏设置",
  "Open *About phone*, tap ***Version information*** *(if shown)*, then tap ***Software version*** or ***Build number*** ***7 times***. Android then says *“You are now a developer”*. That's just the name of these settings.": "打开*关于手机*，点击***版本信息*** *（如有）*，然后连续点击***软件版本号***或***版本号*** ***7 次***。系统会提示*“您已处于开发者模式”*，这只是这组设置的名称。",
  "Waiting… SolCube moves on by itself": "等待中… SolCube 会自动继续",
  "Switch them on": "打开它",
  "Tap below and turn on the switch at the top, called ***Developer options***. Then come back here.": "点击下方，打开顶部的***开发者选项***开关，然后回到这里。",
  "Link SolCube": "连接 SolCube",
  "SolCube paused, usually after a restart without Wi-Fi. Tap ***Start*** and it reconnects by itself.": "SolCube 已暂停，通常是重启后没有 Wi-Fi。点击***启动***即可自动重新连接。",
  "**1.** Turn on ***Use wireless debugging***, then tap ***Allow***": "**1.** 打开***使用无线调试***，然后点按***允许***",
  "**3.** Pull down notifications, tap ***Enter code*** and type the 6 digits": "**3.** 下拉通知栏，点击***输入配对码***并输入 6 位数字",
  "Ready when you are": "准备好了就开始",
  "Waiting for you to tap Pair device…": "等待你点击“使用配对码配对设备”…",
  "Got it. Now pull down notifications and tap Enter code": "好了。现在下拉通知栏，点击“输入配对码”",
  "Checking the code…": "正在核对配对码…",
  "All set!": "全部完成！",
  "That didn't work. Tap the button to try again; nothing was changed.": "没有成功。点击按钮重试；没有做任何改动。",
  "Skip for now?": "暂时跳过？",
  "*Circle to Search*, *Frame gen*, *Gestures*, *Play together* and *Routines* need the one-minute unlock, so they stay ***locked*** for now.": "*即圈即搜*、*插帧*、*手势*、*多应用同时播放*和*自动化场景*需要一分钟解锁，因此暂时保持***锁定***。",
  "You can still use **Fine volume** and **Double power press**. Tap any locked card to unlock it later.": "你仍可使用**精细音量**和**双击电源键**。之后点击任意锁定的卡片即可解锁。",
  "Skip for now": "暂时跳过",
  "Set it up": "去设置",
  "**Yes.** SolCube uses ***Wireless debugging***, a switch built into Android. It gives SolCube extra abilities without rooting your phone.": "**安全。** SolCube 使用***无线调试***，这是 Android 自带的开关，无需 Root 即可为 SolCube 提供更多能力。",
  "It only connects SolCube to this phone. Nothing goes over the internet, and SolCube collects no data.": "它只把 SolCube 连接到这部手机。不经过互联网，SolCube 也不收集任何数据。",
  "It stays on, together with ***USB debugging***, so SolCube can start by itself after a restart.": "它会与 ***USB 调试*** 一起保持开启，这样重启后 SolCube 能自动启动。",
  "To undo it, turn off ***Developer options*** in Settings.": "如需撤销，在设置中关闭***开发者选项***即可。",
  "Got it": "知道了",
  "Pull down notifications, tap Enter code and type the 6 digits": "下拉通知栏，点击“输入配对码”并输入 6 位数字",
  "Keep SolCube running": "让 SolCube 保持运行",
  "vivo pauses apps in the background to save battery. Allow SolCube there, or Gestures, Routines and Circle to Search can stop after a while.\n\nFind SolCube in the list and turn it on.": "vivo 会暂停后台应用以节省电量。请在这里允许 SolCube，否则手势、自动化场景和即圈即搜可能过一会儿就停止工作。\n\n在列表中找到 SolCube 并打开。",
  "Needs the one-minute unlock": "需要一分钟解锁",
  "Set it up yourself": "自己设置",
  "Without the one-minute unlock, SolCube can't do this for you. Double-press the power button, pick SolCube and tap Always.\n\nIf nothing happens, first turn on “Double press the Power button to quickly swipe cards” in vivo Wallet.": "没有一分钟解锁，SolCube 无法替你完成。双击电源键，选择 SolCube 并点击“始终”。\n\n如果没有反应，请先在 vivo 钱包中打开“双击电源键快速刷卡”。",
  "Unlock instead": "改为解锁",
  "OK": "确定",
  "**Connect to Wi-Fi** to continue.": "**请连接 Wi-Fi** 后继续。"
